"Aurora · /work/demo · bugfix · pair   ⠋ planning…                                                   "
" 1┌ Keys (Esc closes) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  "
"┌▶│Skills tab                                                                                    │─┐"
"│P│  r                  Re-run the install plan (aurora skills plan)                             │e│"
"│ │  i                  Include or drop the selected opt-in skill (--with)                       │ │"
"│ │  Enter              Focus the detail pane                                                    │ │"
"│ │                                                                                              │a│"
"│ │Lists and tabs                                                                                │ │"
"│ │  1 2 3 4            Switch tab: 1 Skills, 2 Roles, 3 Install, 4 Runs                         │ │"
"│ │  [                  Previous tab                                                             │ │"
"│ │  ]                  Next tab                                                                 │ │"
"│ │  Tab                Move focus between the list and the detail pane                          │ │"
"│ │  S-Tab              Move focus back                                                          │ │"
"│ │  j ↓                Move down                                                                │ │"
"│ │  k ↑                Move up                                                                  │ │"
"│ │  g Home             Go to the first item                                                     │ │"
"│ │  G End              Go to the last item                                                      │ │"
"│ │  PgDn ^D            Page down                                                                │ │"
"│ │  PgUp ^U            Page up                                                                  │ │"
"│ │  /                  Filter the list (live; Enter keeps, Esc clears)                          │ │"
"│ │  Esc                Back out one level: clear the filter, then return to the list            │ │"
"│ │  ?                  Show this help                                                           │ │"
"│ │  q                  Quit (from the top level)                                                │ │"
"│ │                                                                                              │ │"
"│ │While filtering                                                                               │ │"
"│ │  Enter              Keep the filter and return to the list                                   │ │"
"│ │  Esc                Clear the filter                                                         │ │"
"│ │                                                                                              │ │"
"│ │Help                                                                                          │ │"
"│ │  Esc q ?            Close the popup                                                          │ │"
"│ │  j ↓                Scroll down                                                              │ │"
"│ │  k ↑                Scroll up                                                                │ │"
"│ │                                                                                              │ │"
"│ │Confirm dialog                                                                                │ │"
"│ │  y                  Yes: go ahead                                                            │ │"
"│ │  n Esc Enter q      No (also Esc and Enter: the default is No)                               │ │"
